  "worked_solution": "The operation ${R}_{1}\u2194{R}_{2}$ means that we need to swap the first and second rows.\n\nApplying this row operation, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 3 & 6 \\\\ 4 & -1 & 3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1}\u2194{R}_{2} \\\\  & \u223c[\\begin{aligned}3 & 3 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 8 & 1 \\\\ 4 & -1 & 3\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
